# math.core: the arithmetic every package can rely on.
#
# Exact rational arithmetic, units, comparisons, intervals, abs/min/max and
# equation solving are built into the language (docs/LANGUAGE.md, "Native
# math"), so this package declares only shared vocabulary for now. Milestone 5
# adds linear systems, divisibility, parity and induction schemas with tests.
package math.core @0.1

predicate positive(x: Number) world closed
predicate nonzero(x: Number) world closed
